# Optional PAID generation. A key alone does not spend credits. Explicitly pass --mesh
# or --remesh to ask Meshy (https://www.meshy.ai) for a textured
# 3D model from up to four reference photos (multi-image-to-3D) and stores it, slimmed for the
# web, as public/items/<id>/model.glb. Each model costs credits and takes a few minutes.
# Normal ingest and browser intake use free image-based assets.
MESHY_API_KEY=
